[b]CSS v1.0.0-beta.8[/b]

[list]
[*]Outfits can hide sheer fabric independently of metal details and glow.
[*]Raised the customization limit from 32 to 64 controls per variant.
[/list]

Fabric controls need outfit support. Unholy Genessa v0.2.0 uses these additions.

Close the game, extract into [b]MortalShell2/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/[/b] and overwrite. Keep your [b]CustomShellSystem/state/[/b] folder.
